        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 2.3MW, onshore, tower, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 2.3MW, onshore, tower, steel
UUID=aa1733ce-f3b7-4f95-9fb6-5ed2992394bc
Wind turbine tower, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Vestas V90-2.0MW onshore wind turbine (Garrett &amp; Rønde, 2011).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aa1733ce-f3b7-4f95-9fb6-5ed2992394bc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
